{"title":"Dune Marauder","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 29 Raider that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 2 times (7.7% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/dune-whetstone\">Dune Whetstone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/quality-and-enchanting\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder?lv=27\">Lv 27 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder?lv=28\">Lv 28 <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder?lv=29\">Lv 29 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder?lv=30\">Lv 30 <span>24</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder?lv=31\">Lv 31 <span>24</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder?lv=32\">Lv 32 <span>9</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder?lv=27\" title=\"Pick level 27\"><td><b>27</b></td><td>100</td><td>19.4</td><td>1,350</td><td class=\"muted\">300 · 27.2 · 4,050</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Marauder%20Warcamp\">Marauder Warcamp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>28</b></td><td>106</td><td>19.9</td><td>1,400</td><td class=\"muted\">318 · 27.9 · 4,200</td><td>4</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Marauder%20Warcamp\">Marauder Warcamp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder?lv=29\" title=\"Pick level 29\"><td><b>29</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>111</td><td>20.5</td><td>1,450</td><td class=\"muted\">333 · 28.7 · 4,350</td><td>2</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Marauder%20Warcamp\">Marauder Warcamp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder?lv=30\" title=\"Pick level 30\"><td><b>30</b></td><td>118</td><td>21</td><td>1,500</td><td class=\"muted\">354 · 29.4 · 4,500</td><td>24</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Dune%20Raider%20Stronghold\">Dune Raider Stronghold</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder?lv=31\" title=\"Pick level 31\"><td><b>31</b></td><td>124</td><td>21.6</td><td>1,550</td><td class=\"muted\">372 · 30.2 · 4,650</td><td>24</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Dune%20Raider%20Stronghold\">Dune Raider Stronghold</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder?lv=32\" title=\"Pick level 32\"><td><b>32</b></td><td>131</td><td>22.1</td><td>1,600</td><td class=\"muted\">393 · 30.9 · 4,800</td><td>9</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Dune%20Raider%20Stronghold\">Dune Raider Stronghold</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"dune-marauder\" data-map-level=\"28\">Show level 28 on the map</button>\n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/491a153af36e89ea9f44.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 25–44 · Werewolfpelt armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/28b1cb4119d77a502c7c.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Fire)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 25–44 · Ogrewax armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/dff24264bda2498de69b.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Warrior</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 7 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 7 looted corpses, 46 recorded drops, 1,941 total, 18–102 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/7</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"arrow\" title=\"Arrow - in 14% of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 3 total, 3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f8e0f872cc502e1dabe7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Arrow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">14% · 1/7</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dunehide-head\" title=\"Dunehide Head - in 14% of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/1981696ba13bfd1bd890.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dunehide Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">14% · 1/7</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Good: 1 of 1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"black-walnut-crossbow\" title=\"Black Walnut Crossbow - in 14% of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9eb6bfca42dff868e02b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Black Walnut Crossbow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">14% · 1/7</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Good: 1 of 1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+4 more\">+4 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bearhide-feet\" title=\"Bearhide Feet - in 14% of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/194881d2e0ebbc92b3cd.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bearhide Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">14% · 1/7</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gem-pearl\" title=\"Gem Pearl - in 14% of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a8e7d0e0c97b577cea1a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gem Pearl</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">14% · 1/7</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"scroll-fireball\" title=\"Scroll Fireball - in 14% of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6b66cd8cfb8dcdd17e1d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Scroll Fireball</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">14% · 1/7</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dunehide-torso\" title=\"Dunehide Torso - in 14% of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2f07aeaeaa695ea8bac0.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dunehide Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">14% · 1/7</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div c